WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.880
You know, you got… you got nice color skin.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:08.925
Ernest: What color would you say that is?

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:11.803
My color.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:16.349
♪

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.517
William: The Osage.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:18.309
[TRAIN WHISTLE]

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.562
William: They have the worst land possible.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.689
♪

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.357
William: But they outsmarted everybody.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:24.816
♪

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.276
William: The land had oil on it.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.360
♪

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.236
William: Black gold.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:29.779
♪

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:31.823
Money flows freely here now.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:33.491
I do love that money, sir.

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:34.617
[LAUGHS]

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:43.918
♪

00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:46.004
William: This wealth should come to us.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:49.674
♪

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:50.383
Their time is over.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.844
♪

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:54.679
William: It's just gonna be another tragedy.

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:55.555
♪

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.433
♪

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.976
Paul: When this money start comin’...

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:01.436
♪

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:03.605
Paul: We shoulda known it came with something else.

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:07.066
♪

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.402
Paul: They’re like buzzards circling our people.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.279
♪

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.530
We’re still warriors.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:19.078
♪

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:20.622
Mollie: I oughta kill these white men

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:21.956
Mollie: who killed my family.

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:24.584
♪

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.002
I need you here.

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:27.295
I am right here.

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:30.840
♪

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.382
William: You got to take

00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:33.176
back control of your home.

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:36.763
♪

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:38.264
Tom: I was, uh…

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:39.724
sent down from Washington D.C.

00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:40.892
to see about these murders.

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:43.019
See what about 'em?

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.230
See who’s doing it.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:59.702
♪

00:01:59.702 --> 00:02:01.454
[EXPLOSION]

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.666
[SCREAMING]

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.043
William: Expecting a miracle to make all this go away...

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:09.462
[SCREAMING]

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:12.465
You know they don’t happen anymore.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:22.851
♪

